Subject: [PATCH 5/7] RISC-V: KVM: Add ONE_REG interface for AIA CSRs
Date: Thu, 12 Jan 2023 19:33:02 +0530
Message-Id: <20230112140304.1830648-6-apatel@ventanamicro.com>
